      "comment" : "Siri's answer after nope. switched to the telephoto rear camera."
    },
    "Now using the ultra wide camera." : {
      "comment" : "Siri's answer after nope. switched to the ultra wide rear camera."
    },
    "Now using the wide camera." : {
      "comment" : "Siri's answer after nope. switched to the wide (main) rear camera."
    },
    "Number of Photos" : {
      "comment" : "A setting of nope.'s actions: how many photos to take."
    },
    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "Night mode turned off, in nope.'s Set Night Mode action."
    },
