      "comment" : "Night mode turned on, in nope.'s Set Night Mode action."
    },
    "Open nope." : {
      "comment" : "The name of the control that opens nope.'s camera, in Control Center and on the Lock Screen. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged."
    },
    "Open nope. to allow camera access." : {
      "comment" : "Siri's answer when nope. hasn't asked for camera access yet. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged."
    },
    "Open the Camera" : {
      "comment" : "The name of the action that opens nope.'s camera, in the Shortcuts app."
    },
    "Opens nope. and applies a settings preset: Factory Defaults or one you saved. You can undo it in Presets." : {
      "comment" : "Describes nope.'s Apply Preset action in the Shortcuts app. Presets is the name of the list in nope.'s Settings. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged."
    },
    "Opens nope. and chooses the standard or the largest photo size of a lens that offers more than one." : {
      "comment" : "Describes nope.'s Set Photo Size action in the Shortcuts app. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged."
    },
    "Opens nope. and limits autofocus to near subjects (Close-Up) or far subjects (Far Focus), or lifts the limit." : {
      "comment" : "Describes nope.'s Set Focus Range action in the Shortcuts app. Close-Up and Far Focus are the names of the camera's controls. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged."
    },
    "Opens nope. and starts a series of photos at a fixed interval." : {
      "comment" : "Describes nope.'s Start Interval Shooting action in the Shortcuts app. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged."
    },
